('ielts-b2-spk2-004', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Useful Online Course or Video', 'Describe an online course or video that taught you something useful. You should say: what it was about; how you found it; what you learned from it; and explain why it was useful to you. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-005', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Time You Were Very Busy', 'Describe a time when you were very busy. You should say: when it was; what you had to do; how you managed your time; and explain how you felt during that time. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-006', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Person Who Is Good at Their Job', 'Describe a person you know who is very good at their job. You should say: who the person is; what their job is; what they do in their work; and explain why you think they are good at it. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-007', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Place Where You Like to Relax', 'Describe a place where you like to relax. You should say: where it is; how often you go there; what you do there; and explain why it helps you relax. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-008', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Long Walk You Took', 'Describe a long walk you once took. You should say: where you walked; who you were with; what you saw on the way; and explain how you felt at the end of the walk. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-009', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Time You Borrowed Something', 'Describe a time when you borrowed something from someone. You should say: what you borrowed; who you borrowed it from; why you needed it; and explain how you felt about borrowing it. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-010', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'An Important Decision Made by Your Family', 'Describe an important decision that your family made together. You should say: what the decision was; when it was made; how your family reached the decision; and explain how it affected you. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-011', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Skill You Would Like to Learn', 'Describe a skill you would like to learn in the future. You should say: what the skill is; how you would learn it; how long it might take; and explain why you want to learn it. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-012', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Time You Saw a Beautiful View', 'Describe a time when you saw a beautiful view. You should say: where you were; what you could see; who you were with; and explain why the view was so memorable. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-013', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Club or Group You Belong To', 'Describe a club or group that you belong to or used to belong to. You should say: what kind of group it is; how you joined it; what the members do together; and explain why you like being part of it. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-014', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Small Business You Know', 'Describe a small business that you know. You should say: what the business is; where it is; who runs it; and explain why you think it is successful or unsuccessful. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-015', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Time You Had to Be Patient', 'Describe a time when you had to be patient. You should say: when it was; what you were waiting for; what you did while you waited; and explain how you managed to stay patient. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-016', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Film You Would Watch Again', 'Describe a film you would like to watch again. You should say: what the film is; when you first watched it; what it is about; and explain why you would like to watch it again. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-017', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Tradition in Your Country', 'Describe a traditional custom or practice in your country. You should say: what the tradition is; when it takes place; what people do; and explain why it is important to people. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-018', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Time You Taught Yourself Something', 'Describe something you taught yourself to do. You should say: what you learned; why you decided to learn it; how you taught yourself; and explain how you felt when you were able to do it. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-019', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'An Outdoor Activity You Enjoyed', 'Describe an outdoor activity that you enjoyed doing. You should say: what the activity was; where you did it; who you did it with; and explain why you enjoyed it. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-020', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Time You Received Good Service', 'Describe a time when you received very good service in a shop or restaurant. You should say: where you were; what happened; who served you; and explain why you think the service was so good. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-021', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Goal You Hope to Achieve', 'Describe a goal you hope to achieve in the next few years. You should say: what the goal is; when you set it; what you are doing to achieve it; and explain why this goal matters to you. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-022', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Time You Were Surprised', 'Describe a time when something surprised you. You should say: when it happened; where you were; what the surprise was; and explain how you reacted. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-023', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Room You Remember From Childhood', 'Describe a room you remember from your childhood. You should say: where the room was; what it looked like; what you did there; and explain why you remember it so well. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-024', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'An Interesting Job', 'Describe a job that you think would be interesting to do. You should say: what the job is; what people in this job do; what skills it needs; and explain why you think it would be interesting. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
