('ielts-b2-spk2-026', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Public Event You Attended', 'Describe a public event that you attended, such as a concert, match or show. You should say: what the event was; where and when it took place; who you went with; and explain what made it memorable. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-027', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Time You Solved a Problem', 'Describe a time when you solved a difficult problem. You should say: what the problem was; when it happened; how you solved it; and explain how you felt when the problem was solved. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-028', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Healthy Habit You Have', 'Describe a healthy habit that you have. You should say: what the habit is; when you started it; how often you do it; and explain how it has helped you. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-029', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Famous Place in Your Country', 'Describe a famous place in your country that you have visited. You should say: where it is; why it is famous; what you did there; and explain what you thought of it. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-030', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Time You Apologised', 'Describe a time when you apologised to someone. You should say: who you apologised to; what had happened; how you apologised; and explain how the other person reacted. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ielts-b2-spk2-031', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'speaking', 'ielts-speaking-part2', 'Speaking Part 2 (Cue Card)', 'A Child You Know', 'Describe a child you know well. You should say: who the child is; how you know them; what they are like; and explain how you feel about spending time with them. You have one minute to prepare and may make notes. Speak for one to two minutes.', 120, 60, 15, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Speaking'], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
