Write at least 150 words. You should spend about 20 minutes on this task.', 1200, 0, 20, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Writing'], 'Men aged 16-24 exercised most (5.5 hours) and exercise fell with age for men, to 2.5 hours for over-65s. Women’s exercise also fell, to 3.0 hours at 35-44, but then levelled off (3.1 and 2.9 hours), so from age 45 women exercised more than men (3.1 v 2.8; 2.9 v 2.5). The gender gap was widest among the youngest group.', 'data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22760%22%20height%3D%22470%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20760%20470%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22760%22%20height%3D%22470%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%20fill%3D%22%23172554%22%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22380.0%22%20y%3D%2228%22%20font-size%3D%2218%22%20font-weight%3D%22bold%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%3EWeekly%20hours%20of%20exercise%20by%20age%20group%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Cline%20x1%3D%2290%22%20y1%3D%22370.0%22%20x2%3D%22610%22%20y2%3D%22370.0%22%20stroke%3D%22%23e2e8f0%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2282%22%20y%3D%22374.0%22%20font-size%3D%2212%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%3E0%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Cline%20x1%3D%2290%22%20y1%3D%22308.0%22%20x2%3D%22610%22%20y2%3D%22308.0%22%20stroke%3D%22%23e2e8f0%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2282%22%20y%3D%22312.0%22%20font-size%3D%2212%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%3E2%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Cline%20x1%3D%2290%22%20y1%3D%22246.0%22%20x2%3D%22610%22%20y2%3D%22246.0%22%20stroke%3D%22%23e2e8f0%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2282%22%20y%3D%22250.0%22%20font-size%3D%2212%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%3E4%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Cline%20x1%3D%2290%22%20y1%3D%22184.0%22%20x2%3D%22610%22%20y2%3D%22184.0%22%20stroke%3D%22%23e2e8f0%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2282%22%20y%3D%22188.0%22%20font-size%3D%2212%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%3E6%3C%2Ftext%3E%3Cline%20x1%3D%2290%22%20y1%3D%22122.0%22%20x2%3D%22610%22%20y2%3D%22122.0%22%20stroke%3D%22%23e2e8f0%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2282%22%20y%3D%22126.0%22%20font-size%3D%2212%22%20tex