The annual electricity used by six appliances in an older house and a new energy-efficient house in Dunmore.
Unit: kilowatt hours per year
Series | Heating | Water heater | Fridge | Lighting | Washing machine | Television
Older house | 4,200 | 2,100 | 600 | 500 | 350 | 250
New house | 1,500 | 1,200 | 300 | 120 | 200 | 180
