2025: Clean water projects 52%, Education 18%, Fundraising 10%, Administration 6%, Emergency aid 14%
Main features: Clean water projects took the largest share in both years, rising from 45% to 52%. Emergency aid almost doubled (8% to 14%). Spending on administration halved to 6% and fundraising fell from 15% to 10%, so a larger proportion went on the charity’s work.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
