Hotel | Price per night ($) | Rooms | Distance to beach (km) | Guest rating (out of 10)
Seaview | 180 | 120 | 0.2 | 8.9
Harbour Inn | 95 | 40 | 1.5 | 8.2
Grand Palace | 240 | 300 | 3.0 | 7.4
Budget Stay | 60 | 85 | 4.5 | 6.1
Main features: Seaview was closest to the beach and had the highest rating (8.9) despite a mid-to-high price. The Grand Palace was the most expensive and largest hotel but rated only 7.4. Budget Stay was cheapest, furthest from the beach and lowest rated, while Harbour Inn offered good value with a rating of 8.2 at $95.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
