Smartphone ownership and daily use among adults of different ages in Corvale.
Age group | Own a smartphone (%) | Daily hours of use | Main use
18-29 | 98 | 5.2 | Social media
30-44 | 95 | 3.8 | Messaging
45-59 | 84 | 2.6 | News
60-74 | 62 | 1.5 | Calls
75+ | 35 | 0.8 | Calls
Main features: Ownership and use both fell with age: 98% of 18-29s owned a smartphone and used it 5.2 hours a day, compared with 35% and 0.8 hours for those over 75. Younger adults mainly used phones for social media and messaging, while the two oldest groups used them mainly for calls.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
