Food | Calories | Sugar (g) | Protein (g) | Fibre (g)
Porridge oats | 370 | 1 | 11 | 9
Frosted cereal | 380 | 35 | 6 | 2
White bread | 265 | 4 | 9 | 3
Yoghurt | 95 | 12 | 5 | 0
Eggs | 145 | 0 | 13 | 0
