('ielts-b2-lfb-001', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-fill-blanks', 'Fill in the blanks', 'Joining a gym', 'Listen and complete the notes. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer. This is a short practice drill with synthesised playback.', 180, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Listening'], 'The recording gives these answers in order: 40, towel, Marco. Do not include extra words.', NULL, NULL, 'Receptionist: Hello, Parkside Gym. Caller: Hi, I''d like to join. What''s the monthly fee? Receptionist: It''s forty pounds, or thirty-five if you pay for a year in advance. Caller: I''ll pay monthly for now. Do I need to bring anything on my first visit? Receptionist: Just a towel. We give everyone a locker, so you don''t need a padlock. And your first session is with a trainer called Marco.', 'Monthly fee: £____ (1)
