('ielts-b2-lfb-004', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-fill-blanks', 'Fill in the blanks', 'Evening language course', 'Listen and complete the notes. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer. This is a short practice drill with synthesised playback.', 180, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Listening'], 'The recording gives these answers in order: Monday, library, 22. Do not include extra words.', NULL, NULL, 'Woman: I''m calling about the Spanish course. Adviser: Yes, the beginners'' class meets on Mondays. It was on Wednesdays last term, but the teacher changed the day. Woman: Monday suits me. Where is it held? Adviser: In the library, on the second floor. The course book costs twenty-two dollars, and you can buy it at the first class.', 'Day: ____ (1)
