('ielts-b2-lfb-005', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-fill-blanks', 'Fill in the blanks', 'Volunteer at an animal shelter', 'Listen and complete the notes. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer. This is a short practice drill with synthesised playback.', 180, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Listening'], 'The recording gives these answers in order: cleaning, boots, Saturday. Do not include extra words.', NULL, NULL, 'Coordinator: Thanks for offering to volunteer. Most of our volunteers walk the dogs, but we really need help with cleaning at the moment. Man: That''s fine. Coordinator: Great. Shifts start at eight in the morning. Please wear boots because the floors are often wet. And you''ll need to complete a short training session on Saturday before you start.', 'Main job needed: ____ (1)
