('ielts-b2-lfb-037', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-fill-blanks', 'Fill in the blanks', 'Lecture: Noise in offices', 'Listen and complete the notes. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer. This is a short practice drill with synthesised playback.', 180, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Listening'], 'The recording gives these answers in order: communication, calls, quiet. Do not include extra words.', NULL, NULL, 'Lecturer: Open-plan offices were meant to improve communication, but studies found that people actually spoke face to face less. The main complaint was noise from phone calls. Productivity improved when companies created small quiet rooms.', 'Aim of open-plan offices: better ____ (1)
