('ielts-b2-lmcq-044', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-mcq', 'Choose the correct answer', 'What surprised the researchers', 'What surprised the researchers? Choose ONE letter, A, B or C. Synthesised practice audio.', 120, 0, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Listening'], 'The speaker says: "they also drove faster than we had predicted". The answer is C: older drivers drove faster than predicted', NULL, NULL, 'Researcher: We expected older drivers to be more careful, and they were. What surprised us was that they also drove faster than we had predicted.', NULL, NULL, '["C"]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "A", "text": "younger drivers were careful"}, {"id": "B", "text": "older drivers were careful"}, {"id": "C", "text": "older drivers drove faster than predicted"}]'::jsonb),
